                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Last bench before the rim, trainer. I mark how deep the road has come — every mark below your boots is a day of stone. Deepcore is past me, and I am not a small mark."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Two Keldas on this stretch, they say — Stoneforge down in the city and Deepmark up here on the rim. She shapes the stone. I measure it. Today I measure you."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Bruno runs the Fighting gym past the rim and he respects nothing the road did not test first. Consider me the last test."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Kelda Deepmark",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
